{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29956","headline":"送越州高录事 · 喻凫","name":"送越州高录事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"官曹权纪纲，行李半舟航。\n浦溆潮来广，川源鸟去长。\n笋成稽岭岸，莲发镜湖香。\n泽国还之任，鲈鱼浪得尝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"喻凫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29956.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29956","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}